{
  "$schema": "cache-inventory/1.0.0",
  "takenAt": "2026-11-05",
  "method": "Anonymous shallow clones of each repository's default branch at the time, searched for actions/cache, artifact reuse by name, GHCR images, git refs and branch stores, on-disk caches and setup-* caches (cache-first CI, CI speed 14). A snapshot, never a declaration: each harness declares its own caches as `cache/1.0.0` nodes.",
